    <article class="prose"><p class="legal-updated">Effective 20 September 2026</p>
      <section id="use"><h2>Using Cramzz</h2><p>You may use and share Cramzz experiments for lawful personal or professional purposes. Do not interfere with the service, probe for vulnerabilities without authorization, automate abusive traffic, manipulate public metrics, impersonate another person or brand, or use an experiment to distribute harmful material.</p></section>
      <section id="availability"><h2>Experimental availability</h2><p>Experiments may change, pause, or be archived after their published evaluation window. We aim to preserve public result pages but do not guarantee uninterrupted availability, puzzle streak continuity, or that a particular feature will remain.</p></section>
      <section id="content"><h2>Intellectual property and sharing</h2><p>Cramzz code is governed by the license in its linked repository. Site copy, original visuals, and brand marks remain their owners’ property. You may share the result text and cards generated for you, provided you do not alter them to misrepresent a result or imply an endorsement.</p></section>
      <section id="sponsorships"><h2>Sponsorships</h2><p>A submission is a request, not acceptance. Placement begins only after written approval, successful captured payment, and creative review. Package-specific timing and deliverables are confirmed before payment. Sponsors must have rights to submitted names, logos, claims, and destination content. The <a href="/sponsor-policy/">Sponsor Policy</a> forms part of these terms.</p></section>
      <section id="liability"><h2>Disclaimers and liability</h2><p>Cramzz is provided “as is” to the extent permitted by law. Games and educational explanations are not professional networking, security, financial, or legal advice. We are not responsible for losses caused by reliance on an experimental feature, third-party services, or links outside our control. Nothing here excludes rights or liabilities that cannot legally be excluded.</p></section>
      <section><h2>Changes and contact</h2><p>Material changes will update the effective date on this page. Questions can be sent to <a href="https://x.com/AbhinavPolimera">@AbhinavPolimera</a>.</p></section>
